UI/GuildWars_WarEndPopup_FinalScore_Desc:
In addition to the <style="Resource_GuildWarsPoints">War Score</style> gained during a war, the winning guild also gets a score bonus, which is based on the combined power of all participating guild members. 

Your guild's bonus: +{[WINNER_TOTAL_COLLECTION_POWER_BONUS]}

All individual war scores are then combined with the bonus and multiplied by the chosen battlefield level's multiplier: {[SCORE_MULTIPLIER]}

This gives your guild's final effective score: {[FINAL_SCORE]}<style="Resource_GuildWarsPoints"></style>

Choose a higher (but tougher) battlefield level for a bigger multiplier!

